<title>USA: Olsten Corp says cooperating with fed probe.</title>
<headline>Olsten Corp says cooperating with fed probe.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olsten Corp said Wednesday that it is cooperating with federal agents investigating certain Florida home health care operations that it manages under contract for Columbia/HCA.</p>
<p>Olsten said federal agents served its Olsten Health Mangement division's Florida facilities with search warrants earlier today.     However, Olsten said in a statement that it</p>
<p>has not been informed of the allegations underlying the search warrants and does not know the scope and nature of the investigation.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
